        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc susceptibility (1000 Oe, 2–300 K) shows χMT = 31.61 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K, remaining nearly constant to 50 K then dropping to 17.58 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K, consistent with weak antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd coupling (fit g = 2.03, J = −0.12 cm−1). Magnetization saturates at 28.02 Nβ at 8 T and 2 K. Magnetic refrigeration/MCE: maximum −ΔSm = 20.43 J K−1 kg−1 for ΔH = 7 T at 2.0 K (theoretical 23.05 J K−1 kg−1).",
